[{"title":"除夕二绝 其二","author":"郭谏臣","text":"抱戚江乡六载馀，灯前惊叹二毛初。\n平生多少风云气，竹帛勋名半已虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22590,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝词四首 其一","author":"郭谏臣","text":"陌上丝丝带雨微，遥知春傍柳条归。\n一年一度常如此，昔日章台今已非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22591,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝词四首 其二","author":"郭谏臣","text":"袅袅柔条锁翠烟，随风乱舞绿窗前。\n楚王宫里人多少，如此腰肢亦可怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22592,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝词四首 其三","author":"郭谏臣","text":"雨织金丝绿未敷，隔窗偷眼看模糊。\n画眉京兆今何处，试问双眉得似无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22593,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝词四首 其四","author":"郭谏臣","text":"河桥青眼竞窥春，淡著烟光别样新。\n留却长条休浪折，春来多少远行人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22594,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早发南行口占","author":"郭谏臣","text":"泽国春寒花事迟，行人临发又愆期。\n今朝放棹梁溪去，处处东风飐酒旗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22595,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中晨起","author":"郭谏臣","text":"破晓船争发，日高人晏眠。\n因酣吴市酒，思煮惠山泉。\n鸟去青云外，帆飞绿水前。\n终朝困尘网，到此独悠然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22596,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿白土酒家","author":"郭谏臣","text":"日落半山阴，仓忙过客心。\n车徒投白下，灯火近青林。\n肆列春盘细，杯添夜漏深。\n儿童进新茗，端可涤尘襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22597,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"路傍折梅戏占","author":"郭谏臣","text":"肩舆屈曲傍山溪，折得梅花手自携。\n蜂蝶也知春意在，随车直过画桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22598,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日留都","author":"郭谏臣","text":"久脱朝簪伏草莱，投閒今上凤凰台。\n马前双阙连云起，天外三山耸翠来。\n好鸟偏从名苑集，奇花多向上林开。\n六朝旧事今何在，欲踵风流愧不才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22599,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中写怀柬董司空刘光禄二省丈","author":"郭谏臣","text":"潦倒江乡数载馀，姓名久不到公车。\n幸承季布千金诺，更得刘公一纸书。\n长揖昔曾容汲黯，倦游今已老相如。\n饶君肯假吹嘘力，浅薄那能赋子虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22600,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中有怀灵殿寺梅花三绝 其一","author":"郭谏臣","text":"野寺梅开千树花，风飘香雪点袈裟。\n自怜清赏难消受，偏到开时不在家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22601,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中有怀灵殿寺梅花三绝 其二","author":"郭谏臣","text":"古殿荒凉梅正繁，春风花满给孤园。\n主人底事忘归去，谁遣清香扑酒樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22602,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中有怀灵殿寺梅花三绝 其三","author":"郭谏臣","text":"二月江乡已落梅，飞花散作白云堆。\n且?醉卧山窗下，疏影还从月下来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22603,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后登虎邱","author":"郭谏臣","text":"兰舟维细柳，与客共攀跻。\n山静花争发，林深鸟乱啼。\n群芳含宿雨，双屐怯春泥。\n杯酒论心久，危阑日己西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22604,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日过城南别业","author":"郭谏臣","text":"放棹城南日未斜，雨馀百卉竞春华。\n迎风弱柳垂金缕，近水夭桃漾锦霞。\n鱼藻轻翻浮别沼，燕泥频掠过东家。\n生逢佳景须乘兴，莫遣香尘污落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22605,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明日舟次邀方司训同往西山","author":"郭谏臣","text":"寒食江村路，门多插柳条。\n市呼新酿熟，客喜宿酲消。\n雨洗山光润，风生花气饶。\n故人原有约，沙际一停桡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22606,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿西山古庵","author":"郭谏臣","text":"落日青山下，停舟共访僧。\n云低檐外塔，香绕佛前灯。\n野旷泉声远，春和花气蒸。\n偶然逢二妙，还许听三乘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22607,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝发古庵","author":"郭谏臣","text":"鸡报山窗晓，时惊客梦残。\n蒲团迎日色，罗袂怯春寒。\n清磬和云落，繁英带露看。\n舟行更回首，高塔出林端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22608,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登七十二峰阁夜宿顾山人家","author":"郭谏臣","text":"闻说桃源万树花，遨游端为惜春华。\n烟霞深闭仙人宅，鱼鸟偏邻处士家。\n湖面流光浮日去，山围断处倚云遮。\n杖头剩有青蚨在，绿酒频沽不用赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22609,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮陆启孙含青轩和方司训韵","author":"郭谏臣","text":"地据湖山胜，诛茅结小亭。\n檐前芳草绿，座上远山青。\n花月春游倦，茶烟午梦醒。\n蟠螭来较晚，香坠锦云屏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22610,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食饮杨氏宅","author":"郭谏臣","text":"佳节偏多雨，荒村入禁烟。\n鸟啼歌扇外，花落舞筵前。\n香雾侵衣薄，微风入座偏。\n主人能劝饮，相对共陶然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22611,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登虞山望湖亭","author":"郭谏臣","text":"湖霁浮银镜，山围列翠屏。\n层台临拂水，曲涧似兰亭。\n莺语岩花媚，龙归洞草腥。\n危阑群胜集，独坐酒初醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22612,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蠡东前园即事二首 其一","author":"郭谏臣","text":"春园门久闭，入径薜萝封。\n林驻茶烟细，衣沾花露浓。\n水边双白鹤，槛外数青松。\n对此幽间境，频过意未慵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22613,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蠡东前园即事二首 其二","author":"郭谏臣","text":"地僻尘氛远，池晴水竹分。\n孤亭明夕照，列树暖春云。\n戏蝶悬蛛网，游鱼避鸭群。\n晚来花下坐，渐觉酒微醺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22614,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淀山湖中","author":"郭谏臣","text":"晓起进兰桡，东行水国饶。\n湖连天共远，日出雾全消。\n独鹤凌风举，群鸥逐浪飘。\n柳村看渐近，青幔映河桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22615,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟次唐行","author":"郭谏臣","text":"江乡逢暮春，一棹舣沙滨。\n客路看飞絮，行厨荐绿蘋。\n冠裳时暂远，鱼鸟渐相亲。\n长啸乾坤里，悠然著此身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22616,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓发大寺镇","author":"郭谏臣","text":"孤村鸡报曙，游子动归桡。\n河带明星落，烟迎旭日消。\n地卑多近水，湖曲不通潮。\n野店香醪熟，侵晨向客招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22617,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沙湖舟行","author":"郭谏臣","text":"昨送春归去，今从湖上来。\n残云随雨尽，远浪拍天回。\n水鸟惊人没，汀花向客开。\n閒来心境寂，无复著纤埃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22618,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"池馆新晴","author":"郭谏臣","text":"园林新雨霁，嫩绿压枝繁。\n戏蝶穿花舞，游鱼出藻翻。\n清香凝曲槛，佳景落幽轩。\n独坐无人到，惟闻鸟雀喧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22619,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日园居写怀","author":"郭谏臣","text":"园径频看趣自成，萧条终日掩柴荆。\n池边久立谙鱼性，树底閒行识鸟声。\n过雨林梢凝断霭，夕阳霞彩弄新晴。\n且将疏懒荒村卧，浮世谁怜阮步兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22620,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昆山晚归漫兴","author":"郭谏臣","text":"百里昆山道，归舟趁晚风。\n霞明千嶂外，日落五湖东。\n未获随仙仗，还堪学钓翁。\n深源真可笑，忽忽自书空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22621,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日园居诸亲友见访","author":"郭谏臣","text":"幽居掩蓬户，端足避尘嚣。\n对酒颜仍破，开轩兴自饶。\n风生香渐远，水近暑潜消。\n故旧携棋局，林间不待邀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22622,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晨起遣兴","author":"郭谏臣","text":"山窗雨过动微凉，对镜俄惊鬓发苍。\n堪叹浮生苦无几，汉庭空自老冯唐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22623,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日过城南别业","author":"郭谏臣","text":"肩舆久不到城南，此日投閒一驻骖。\n近水亭台宜落景，隔篱花竹映澄潭。\n窗间远岫来空翠，雨后长天正郁蓝。\n便欲携家同此隐，炉香茗椀事幽探。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22624,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东宅漫兴","author":"郭谏臣","text":"宅傍青郊曲，盘旋竹树幽。\n石梁空待月，池馆更宜秋。\n云拂阶前树，风清水上楼。\n间来时啸傲，坐觉暑潜收。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22625,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送马宪副同年之楚","author":"郭谏臣","text":"昔日看花曾作伴，今晨把袂若为情。\n欲知此后相思处，黄鹤楼前片月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22626,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送钱秀才兄弟应试","author":"郭谏臣","text":"吴越神明胄，相看尽白眉。\n共乘木兰舫，期折桂花枝。\n乡国凝眸处，都门燕喜时。\n君家兄与弟，静听鹿鸣诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22627,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登上方寺","author":"郭谏臣","text":"路入楞伽寺，明湖映远峰。\n两崖松桧合，一径薜萝封。\n亭逼青霄近，林藏绿荫浓。\n开樽共吟眺，烟树暮重重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22628,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行春桥玩月","author":"郭谏臣","text":"临湖维短棹，天末起凉风。\n皓月飞银镜，长桥偃玉虹。\n望中烟翳景，席畔水涵空。\n胜会知难再，酣歌意未穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22629,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新秋夜坐","author":"郭谏臣","text":"小庭宾客散，独坐更移时。\n西岭云生巧，东林月上迟。\n蛩声鸣乱草，萤火照疏篱。\n虚馆清秋夜，幽怀只自知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22630,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蠡东晚归旧宅","author":"郭谏臣","text":"薄暮客西归，舟行载夕晖。\n乱蝉悲露切，宿鸟渡烟微。\n秋水逾明镜，残霞似画衣。\n停桡天渐暝，一犬护柴扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22631,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚发华亭","author":"郭谏臣","text":"向晚兰舟发，人牵锦缆行。\n日穿云窦破，溪接海潮平。\n映水帆樯影，投林鸟雀声。\n开帘下阶拜，遥想故人情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22632,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟次嘉善县漫兴二首 其一","author":"郭谏臣","text":"江郭怜孤往，西风洒客裳。\n雨晴林叶润，日暖稻花香。\n白发催年迈，沧洲引兴长。\n鲈鱼秋正好，归思不能忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22633,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟次嘉善县漫兴二首 其二","author":"郭谏臣","text":"返棹孤城下，轻云近女墙。\n槿红初过雨，橘绿未经霜。\n景物看来变，浮生祇自忙。\n冯唐真易老，白首尚为郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22634,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊嘉兴城同年戚符卿过访","author":"郭谏臣","text":"访旧嘉禾郡，城头暮色催。\n水边孤艇泊，灯下故人来。\n惠我多新句，酬君愧不才。\n何时重放棹，同上越王台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22635,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴江道中二首 其一","author":"郭谏臣","text":"雨后松陵道，西风吹布袍。\n帆飞秋水阔，雁度暮云高。\n野店乞残火，行厨进浊醪。\n微吟残照里，独坐检离骚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22636,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴江道中二首 其二","author":"郭谏臣","text":"扬舲过笠泽，回望是姑苏。\n驿路分南北，烟帆半有无。\n孤城临巨浸，平野插浮图。\n今夜长桥月，清光映玉壶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22637,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋晚过虎邱","author":"郭谏臣","text":"兰舟初雨霁，正值暮钟时。\n酒为藏阄醉，棋堪应劫迟。\n烟迷兰若寺，露冷桂花枝。\n月出云还翳，空辜石上期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22638,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早发冶场泾","author":"郭谏臣","text":"客路宵分后，茫茫烟景迷。\n孤舟行载月，数里未闻鸡。\n白露侵帆湿，明河向水低。\n棹歌惊梦断，已到蠡塘西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22639,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游桂岭","author":"郭谏臣","text":"西岭千年桂，阴森入翠微。\n琼枝云外绿，金粟雨中肥。\n影落浮杯酒，香飘袭客衣。\n当年和露折，曾向广寒归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22640,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠碧峰上人","author":"郭谏臣","text":"古刹深山里，幽栖独旻公。\n三乘闻己悟，五蕴本来空。\n止水禅心似，孤峰色相同。\n蒲团深岁月，龛外雨花红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22641,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游天池","author":"郭谏臣","text":"穿云跻碧岭，遥望近丹邱。\n雨歇金莲霁，烟涵石屋秋。\n楼台开绝境，花竹映清流。\n红叶苍山暮，停车为尔留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22642,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出山","author":"郭谏臣","text":"昨朝远赴野人期，短棹琴樽带雨移。\n山阁烟霞秋霁后，法堂灯火夜深时。\n竹间共喜高僧话，石上惭无幼妇词。\n桂岭天池耽胜赏，舟人休讶出山迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22643,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹梧书院晨起","author":"郭谏臣","text":"日高三丈迟迟起，阑干曲曲人频倚。\n秋风落叶满庭除，呼童扫叶收梧子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22644,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠伊母太淑人","author":"郭谏臣","text":"堂上萱花岁月长，阶前兰玉竞芬芳。\n南宫仙吏称觞后，双袖犹沾粉署香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22645,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送近冈吴太守入觐二绝 其一","author":"郭谏臣","text":"天皇出御未央宫，万国衣冠入觐同。\n借问循良谁第一，汉庭无复过吴公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22646,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送近冈吴太守入觐二绝 其二","author":"郭谏臣","text":"满路吴民起颂声，愿言借寇向承明。\n春风三月棠阴下，多少儿童竹马迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22647,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送长洲陈明府入觐","author":"郭谏臣","text":"朔风吹袂冷，鞍马去京师。\n天外双凫远，云中一鹤随。\n赋先群邑起，绩报九重知。\n花县归宜早，徵书渐及期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22648,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊严墓镇灯下闻歌","author":"郭谏臣","text":"客路黄昏后，移舟近钓矶。\n夜长频剪烛，露冷欲添衣。\n桑落浮杯绿，车螯入馔肥。\n醉馀闻妙曲，响遏白云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22649,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴江道中","author":"郭谏臣","text":"言返嘉禾棹，时过钓雪滩。\n平湖环县霁，高塔入云寒。\n沙岸芦花白，霜林枫叶丹。\n开帘看旅雁，点点落江干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22650,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村晚","author":"郭谏臣","text":"细雨孤村暮，呼僮扃竹扉。\n床头新酿熟，座上故人稀。\n野寺昏钟起，烟林宿鸟归。\n有怀清耿耿，檐外片云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22651,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日与客游西山","author":"郭谏臣","text":"孟冬风日煖，与客共登山。\n一岭界天上，诸峰隐树间。\n茶花随地白，霜叶满林斑。\n回首天将暮，僧从落照还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22652,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟发娄门夜抵昆山","author":"郭谏臣","text":"扬舲过湖曲，沽酒近唯亭。\n娄水浮烟白，昆山拥县青。\n乱鸦栖暝树，飞鸟下寒汀。\n夜傍渔舟宿，时闻虾菜腥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22653,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陆春元北上","author":"郭谏臣","text":"阊阖风生白雁高，征人寒拥赤霜袍。\n羡君北上陈三策，愧我南来渐二毛。\n剪烛夜倾桑落酒，扬帆时度广陵涛。\n看花上苑春将近，不惜临行赠佩刀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22654,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金阊送别晚归","author":"郭谏臣","text":"金阊时送别，落日照清樽。\n山近云常绕，天寒水易昏。\n雁迷千嶂雨，犬吠数家村。\n归路休言晚，严城未掩门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22655,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胥江送陈明府入觐兼寄申王韩三内翰二首 其一","author":"郭谏臣","text":"送客胥江别，微茫烟景分。\n舟前见新月，天际敛轻云。\n夙有林泉兴，惭无竹帛勋。\n封书寄朝贵，应念久离群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22656,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胥江送陈明府入觐兼寄申王韩三内翰二首 其二","author":"郭谏臣","text":"数载江乡卧，曾无政府书。\n未须嗟失马，久已愿焚鱼。\n啸傲乾坤阔，优游岁月徂。\n故人俱侍从，肯忆病相如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22657,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒋云涯太守自高凉入觐因归省吴中赋此为赠","author":"郭谏臣","text":"岭外风尘暗百蛮，今朝喜得故人还。\n畏途潦倒心犹壮，炎海驱驰鬓欲斑。\n岁晏冲寒朝魏阙，夜深飞梦绕吴山。\n归期屈指春将暮，三径花开白日閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22658,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城中夜归","author":"郭谏臣","text":"日落归心促，天高朔气凝。\n月明寒渡水，烟白夜船灯。\n疏懒真堪弃，脂韦素未能。\n拙哉萧狷叟，垂老乞为僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22659,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晨起得起官报","author":"郭谏臣","text":"懒性甘终弃，除书忽漫传。\n阳乌分树杪，晨鹊噪檐前。\n地忝铨衡重，心惭水镜悬。\n皇恩真浩荡，舒眼望青天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22660,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]